{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_013_02_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:50865bef2db0194cb85b616d1de5fe00fa40d2dc80fce31c56704942506d3cd2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03f5bda04b0178fa6e846e35d4243b5de26b92eec07f58ed88382044b68ae1bb",
      "text": "（……找圆城寺先生陪我来真是太好了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fcd0b69f31c966edb8af5fac8587994308977d850b5e5b55c97f0c884e47cf8",
      "text": "那，我们这就告辞了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2855fac9abc21c70fdd34d93867281f53b8c0992ec021685dd6ffedb49cdb524",
      "text": "道流先生，不好意思！\n能再耽搁您一点点时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a4158795f3b56a7b2192bc75ba0f2211b68ddb87b03d4aa26d9b7098143a5b9",
      "text": "嗯，找我？怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddb69a9a55977882de29282e396367e4fc22af9c043cc9f5b0b9daa46c45c1c9",
      "text": "道流先生，您要不要也成为偶像呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e71bbee6960e302d95a6f37b80e11f0f71337cb8754022fac68834188b4c7f8e",
      "text": "哎！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:752c1797566c2f784ffd292620a4cd6e72fb5862fa25b9876615cef61c5e15e6",
      "text": "偶像！？我吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_d:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bec3f2a11eaeaaa9b94fb34ef05237d1f3830d8fd7fa1d87500e933786e1a6a",
      "text": "从见面的那一瞬间我就有所感觉，\n经过刚才的交谈，我更加确信了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_d:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e9fc610d10133c3d73a6a5b1a531286babe498729ae6d8024814bf2ff9f882f",
      "text": "在您身上，我也感受到了偶像的潜质。\n要不要和武先生一起参加试镜呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_d:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bed58ab5bd95921614b1455972103a26be1e7aab0f80bf429847c463571bd151",
      "text": "没、没有啦。我身上\n还有拉面店的工作在做……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_d:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a481a3a6a1f7cce1652668a034e7aee4261cf284cfa1a301a9b8aac6ea00db59",
      "text": "兼任偶像也是完全没问题的！\n能不能请您带回去考虑一下呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_d:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:537ed73535b56121a9b4faa84a72f3b442ca57e1a8301398eb6aed6247450ce7",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_d:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c1c961e2b96927aa34007cad77367c168d70e45952a215ade10ebc4e6485b07",
      "text": "（唔——……要是能拿到刚才说的那笔钱，\n买下那栋大楼就有眉目了，但是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
